    "detailed_description": "A spaceship, piloted by the courageous Haru, has wandered in some dangerous region of the astral void. With only the support of a dying starbase, our pilot must survive an incoming armada of vicious aliens that seek to destroy anything and everything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short games that will almost never reach 30 minutes<br></li><li>60 perks to collect<br></li><li>24 items/weapons to upgrade and combine<br></li><li>33 unique enemies to discover<br></li><li>Kill enemies to collect rings that can be used to upgrade weapons and items at the starbase<br></li><li>Kill enemy spawn gates to collect ingots that can be used between games to give passive buffs to the ship systems</li></ul>",
